.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
**/tmp
bin/
storage
docs
loadtest

# Bare `go build` drops a ~52MB binary at the repo root (the module is named
# go-starter-kit, so the output is not covered by bin/). It is ignored by git
# but was still shipped to the Docker daemon on every build.
/go-starter-kit

# Agent/tooling state. Machine-specific, never needed by the build.
.codegraph/
.serena/
graphify-out/
.agent_memory.db
.agent_memory.db-shm
.agent_memory.db-wal
.claude.json
.mcp.json
.cursorrules
.agent-rules.md
gitleaks-report.json
docs/audits/
